"Определяет версию платформы. Формат: ``repo:key``, например "
"``community:2024.11``."
msgstr ""
"Defines the platform version. Format: ``repo:key``, e.g. "
"``community:2024.11``."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/configuration.rst:116
msgid ""
"``repo`` -- идентификатор репозитория бандлов (``community`` или "
"``enterprise``)"
msgstr ""
"``repo`` — bundle repository identifier (``community`` or ``enterprise``)"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/configuration.rst:117
msgid "``key`` -- версия бандла"
msgstr "``key`` — bundle version"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/configuration.rst:119
